<title>UK: LIFFE coffee heads lower, cocoa firm, sugar off PM.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee heads lower, cocoa firm, sugar off PM.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Extends earlier losses as NY heads lower, hovers above session lows. Sept down $40 at $1,820 at 1430 GMT.</p>
<p>COCOA - Gently firmer in light trade, Sept dominates. Up three at 1,114 stg.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Stays in negative territory, volume solid. August down $1.50 at $319.70, others weaker.</p>
</text>
